      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="ofac-faq-item"><div class="views-field views-field-field-topic"><div class="field-content"><div class="treas-text--h2"><strong><a href="/faqs/topic/5671 ">Chinese Military Companies Sanctions</a></strong></div></div></div><div><h1 class="font-sans-lg text-ls-auto text-bold">1046.&nbsp;Are U.S. persons required to divest their current holdings of Chinese Military-Industrial Complex Companies' (CMIC) securities before the end of the relevant 365-day divestment period pursuant to section 1(c) of Executive Order (E.O.) 13959, as amended?
</h1></div></div>

    </div>
  
